#: a39c04a9d2614f0698e3f21620a8170d
msgid "Colophon"
msgstr ""

#: a26b2bc408f44b84a12f5a4949048712
msgid "Diátaxis is the work of `Daniele Procida <https://vurt.eu>`_."
msgstr ""

#: a142c21b14e148339856755766a92d3c
msgid "It has been developed over a number of years, and continues to be elaborated and explored."
msgstr ""

#: af0cc62ad59541b398b76f458f0c856b
msgid "Contact me"
msgstr ""

#: e8feeb5f17b14f30adca491191a3052c
msgid "`Email me <daniele@vurt.org>`_. I enjoy hearing about other people's experiences with Diátaxis and read everything I receive."
msgstr ""

#: 4cc21c442e00451ca46c3752e2605e20
msgid "I appreciate all the interest and do my best to reply, but I get a considerable quantity of email related to Diátaxis and I can't promise to respond to every message."
msgstr ""

#: 5fd9b6e82171454b94e9e2a1eac6483c
msgid "If you'd like to discuss Diátaxis with other users, please see the *#diataxis* channel on the `Write the Docs Slack group <https://www.writethedocs.org/slack/>`_, or the `Discussions <https://github.com/evildmp/diataxis-documentation-framework/discussions>`_ section of the `GitHub repository for this website <https://github.com/evildmp/diataxis-documentation-framework>`_."
msgstr ""

#: 959fc28b55b1444f8d5e8e742d29e5ed
msgid "Origins and development"
msgstr ""

#: 22959dd610fd4867a8d506eaf2179e78
msgid "You can find `an earlier presentation of some of these ideas <https://documentation.divio.com>`_, that I created while working at Divio between 2014-2021. I still agree with most of it, though there are several aspects that I now think I got wrong."
msgstr ""

#: 6bb650b6ce2b44c3a6ab4d147f8f2e57
msgid "The original context for the Diátaxis approach was limited to software product documentation."
msgstr ""

#: 65a8bd6705514bd6ab088d69708fc972
msgid "In 2021 I was awarded a Fellowship of the `Software Sustainability Institute <http://software.ac.uk/blog/sorry-state-usable-software-open-science-results-open-science-retreat>`_, to explore its application in scientific research contexts. More recently I've explored its application in internal corporate documentation, organisational management and education, and also its application at scale. This work is on-going."
msgstr ""

#: ff0d674841ef4b6cb9e5c99a6d56c376
msgid "Other people have corresponded with me to share their experience of applying Diátaxis to note-taking systems and even as part of a systematic approach to household management."
msgstr ""

#: 3a3deaa743b54f73953c66e5effbbd35
msgid "Citation and contribution"
msgstr ""

#: 1c5b5d308cb74bf9944a87a36a46951c
msgid "To cite Diátaxis, please refer to :doc:`this website, diataxis.fr <index>`."
msgstr ""

#: 62def1f4e2d44a5886a566e7914d2c95
msgid "The Git repository for the source material contains a citation file, `CITATION.cff <https://github.com/evildmp/diataxis-documentation-framework/blob/main/CITATION.cff>`_."
msgstr ""

#: b6e9da18df444b42b622aa65560f2e55
msgid "APA and BibTeX metadata are available from the *Cite this repository* option at https://github.com/evildmp/diataxis-documentation-framework."
msgstr ""

#: dc8f2207c0fc471f8ea10ad0d08364d3
msgid "You can also submit a pull request to suggest an improvement or correction, or `file an issue <https://github.com/evildmp/diataxis-documentation-framework/issues>`_."
msgstr ""

#: 30cd2aae2e9f41c28baf2301a5fb2e7e
msgid "Diátaxis is now used in several hundred projects and it is no longer possible for me to keep up with requests to have projects listed here as examples of Diátaxis adoption."
msgstr ""

